        ["The ridge's far towers: one painted card. A row of blades and needles with their feet in painted cloud, the back ones hazed to the storm's grey, a few torn lines painted between them", "70 m wide, 90 m tall, 14 m back", "behind everything east of the face, in front of the storm's deck", "Background, far", "new, made the way the far cards are made"],
        ["The keeper's cabin: plank back wall, a slate roof tucked under the prow, a stove with a pipe, a bunk, a table with the weather book, a coat on a peg, a kettle, one lamp", "4.3 m wide, 2.6 m tall, 2.2 m deep", "the first ledge at 886 m (note 94). The ledge is its porch and you land on it. Smoke from the pipe streams east", "Background, cut away at the front", "new; the lamp is in the kit: lantern_hang"],
