        ["Torn line; torn end on a post", "4.3 m; 1 m", "the torn line hangs from a spar under the prow's tip and starts El Filo. A torn end streams from the top of each line post and of the line pole: four", "Play space; the ends behind", "in the kit: papel_tatters, prayer_flag; the spar is new"],
        ["Line post: a square timber post. Line pole: a black greased steel pipe", "post 2.5 m tall, 0.3 m thick; pole 7.7 m tall, 0.24 m thick", "a post on the needle and on each lone tower: its top is where you launch from. The pole on El Filo's top carries the prayer lines and is not held", "Play space", "new"],
